        "- `assets/`: Game-ready files only, no editable sources.",
        "- `assets/models/`: `.glb` files with their `.import` files.",
        "- `assets/textures/`: Textures for 3D materials.",
        "- `assets/sprites/`: 2D art, atlases and sprite sheets.",
        "- `assets/materials/`: `.tres` materials.",
        "- `assets/shaders/`: `.gdshader` files.",
        "- `assets/animations/`: Animation libraries.",
        "- `assets/audio/`: Game-ready sound.",
        "- `assets/audio/music/`: Looping `.ogg` tracks.",
        "- `assets/audio/sfx/`: Short `.wav` effects.",
        "- `assets/fonts/`: `.ttf` and `.otf` with licences.",
        "- `assets/ui/`: Icons, themes and nine-patch images.",
        "- `scenes/`: `.tscn` files, each with its attached script.",
        "- `scenes/levels/`: Playable levels.",
        "- `scenes/actors/`: Player, enemies and NPCs.",
        "- `scenes/props/`: Interactable and decorative objects.",
        "- `scenes/ui/`: Menus and HUD.",
        "- `scripts/`: Shared GDScript not tied to one scene.",
        "- `autoload/`: Singletons registered in project settings.",
        "- `resources/`: Custom Resource data: items, stats, dialogue.",
        "- `localization/`: Translation `.csv` or `.po` files.",
        "- `tests/`: Automated tests.",
        "- `source-art/`: Editable sources; `.gdignore` keeps Godot out.",
        "- `source-art/blender/`: `.blend` files.",
        "- `source-art/textures/`: Layered paint files.",
        "- `source-art/audio/`: DAW sessions and uncompressed recordings.",
        "- `docs/`: Design doc, controls, level plans.",
        "- `tools/`: Export and conversion scripts.",
        "- `builds/`: Exported builds per platform. Ignored by Git and disposable.",
        "- `release/`: Store text, screenshots, trailer, changelog."
      ]
    },
